// The main process and the preload, in plain Node: no DOM, as they run in Electron's main process
// and its sandboxed preload. The root typecheck runs it beside the renderer's project (tsconfig.json,
// DOM and JSX), which also reaches these files through the tests.
{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "include": [
    "src/main",
    "src/preload",
    "src/sandbox-preload",
    "src/shared",
    "electron-builder.config.ts",
    "scripts/*.d.mts"
  ]
}
